# Product vision

Follow the "Product vision" section of the repository-root `AGENTS.md`. Read
@docs/VISION.md before any significant architectural, design or subjective
product decision and align with it. If an instruction contradicts the vision,
point out the difference and ask whether to proceed and whether to update the
vision; never act against it or change it silently.
